---
import Button from '../components/blocks/Button.astro';
import Img from '../components/blocks/Img.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import img10 from '../assets/images/10.png';
import img26a860b0f from '../assets/images/2-6a860b0f.png';
import img32 from '../assets/images/32.png';
import googleAdsLogo from '../assets/images/google-ads-logo.jpeg';
import kaboompicsElegantBusinesswomanInHerOffic from '../assets/images/kaboompics-elegant-businesswoman-in-her-office-25738.jpg';
import kaboompicsYoungAsianWomanAtOffice21922 from '../assets/images/kaboompics-young-asian-woman-at-office-21922.jpg';
import pattern3 from '../assets/images/pattern-3.png';
import pexelsFirmbeeCom227297016961857 from '../assets/images/pexels-firmbee-com-22729701-6961857.jpg';
import pexelsMikaelBlomkvist4153279 from '../assets/images/pexels-mikael-blomkvist-4153279.jpg';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
---

<Layout title="Google Ads for Therapists | HelloSEO" description="Learn about expert paid Google Ads management at HelloSEO to boost your online advertising performance and drive measurable results." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0} footerOffset="2vw" headerTheme="white">
  <Section theme="white" bg={{ src: pattern3, eager: true }} grid={{ rows: [40, 21], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="2/2/12/10" d="4/17/20/25" z={6} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={pexelsMikaelBlomkvist4153279} alt="A woman with red hair and earrings is working on a laptop at a desk in a bright room." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 33vw" eager />
    <Text m="13/2/26/10" d="4/3/15/14" z={2} align="center">
      <p class="large"><strong>PAID GOOGLE ADS</strong></p>
      <h2>Stay <span class="c-lightAccent">top-of-search</span> (and mind) with Paid Google Ads.</h2>
      <p class="large">If gaining more visibility is high on your practice’s priority list, then adding Paid Google Ads to your SEO plan might be the right next step. </p>
      <p class="large">Through this upgraded service, we’ll work with you to target your ideal clients, increase your online presence, and fill your caseload, fast. </p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="27/2/29/10" d="15/3/17/9" z={5} align="center" href="/contact">Get STarted</Button>
    <Img m="32/4/39/10" d="2/15/10/19" z={7} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={pexelsFirmbeeCom227297016961857} alt="A person using a MacBook Pro at a wooden table with two cups of coffee, a potted plant, and a glass cake stand in a cozy, well-lit room with large windows." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 75vw, 17vw" eager />
    <Img m="30/2/34/5" d="3/23/5/25" z={7} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 2, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }] }] }} src={googleAdsLogo} alt="Google Ads logo with a green, yellow, and blue design." fit="contain" radius="10px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 38vw, 8vw" eager />
  </Section>

  <Section theme="dark" height="medium" bg={{ src: kaboompicsYoungAsianWomanAtOffice21922, overlay: 0.9, parallax: true }} grid={{ rows: [9, 10], rowGap: 11, colGap: 28 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/3/10" d="1/8/3/20" z={1}>
      <h2 class="ta-center">How <span class="c-white">Paid </span><span class="c-accent">Google Ads</span> stack up</h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="3/2/5/10" d="4/2/11/10" z={2} align="center" alignM="start" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="hsl(var(--white-hsl) / 0)" stroke={{ color: 'var(--white)', width: '2px' }} padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="20px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">200% average ROI: </span></h3>
      <p class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">businesses earn roughly $2 for every $1 spent on Google Ads.</span></p>
      <p class="small ta-center"><a target="_blank" href="https://www.webfx.com/blog/marketing/what-is-the-roi-of-google-ads/"><span class="c-white"><u>source</u></span></a></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="5/2/7/10" d="4/10/11/18" z={3} align="center" alignM="start" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="hsl(var(--white-hsl) / 0)" stroke={{ color: 'var(--white)', width: '2px' }} padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="20px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">50% more likely to convert: </span></h3>
      <p class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">searchers who click on a paid ad are more likely to become a client than those who click an organic result alone.</span></p>
      <p class="small ta-center"><a target="_blank" href="https://sqmagazine.co.uk/google-search-statistics/"><span class="c-white"><u>source</u></span></a></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="7/2/9/10" d="4/18/11/26" z={4} align="center" alignM="start" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="hsl(var(--white-hsl) / 0)" stroke={{ color: 'var(--white)', width: '2px' }} padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="20px">
      <h3 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">~90% market share:</span></h3>
      <p class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">Google is still the go-to for the majority of all searches, which means your ads reach the people actively looking for a practice like yours.</span></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section height="medium" grid={{ rows: [27, 16], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/17/10" d="3/3/16/13" z={1}>
      <h2>When Ads and SEO work together, the <span class="c-lightAccent">results</span> are exponential.</h2>
      <p class="large">In a world of silo’d marketing specialists, it’s not uncommon for practices to hire one agency to handle SEO and another to run paid ads. But that results in two teams working two different strategies, often unintentionally steam rolling organic traffic with paid, and vice versa. </p>
      <p>When you have one partner running both SEO and Paid Google Ads simultaneously, they can use organic results as a springboard that informs an effective ads strategy without treating your ads budget as a testing ground. Results come faster with less waste and a lot less effort project managing multiple teams.</p>
    </Text>
    <Img m="18/2/28/10" d="1/16/17/25" z={6} zm={4} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ r: 4 }, {}] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={img32} alt="Two men having a conversation at a table, one facing the camera smiling, the other with back to the camera, in a bright room with a window and potted plant." focal="53% 26.4%" radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 38vw" />
  </Section>

  <Section grid={{ rows: [12, 20], rowGap: 22, colGap: 22 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/3/10" d="1/6/6/22" z={1} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center">Best for newly established or expanding practices looking to build a <span class="c-lightAccent">strong client list</span>.</h2>
      <p class="large ta-center">When you add Paid Google Ads to your existing search strategy, you’ll get: </p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="3/2/5/10" d="6/5/12/14" z={4} zm={2} align="center" alignM="start" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="var(--darkAccent)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h3><span class="c-white">Faster Visibility: </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">Ranking for competitive keywords can take time. Paid Google Ads put you at the top of the results page immediately. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="5/2/7/10" d="12/5/18/14" z={5} zm={3} align="center" alignM="start" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="var(--lightAccent)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h3><span class="c-white">Precise Targeting and Testing: </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">Paid Google Ads allow us to target specific keywords, demographics, and locations. This means we’ll increase your chance of getting the right clients on your caseload. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="7/2/9/10" d="6/14/12/23" z={5} zm={3} align="center" alignM="start" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="var(--mauve)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h3><span class="c-white">More Real Estate on the Results Page: </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">When your practice shows up in both the paid and organic results for the same search query, your click-through rate increases, which means more qualified leads get eyes on your website. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="9/2/11/10" d="12/14/18/23" z={6} zm={4} align="center" alignM="start" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="var(--accent)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h3>A Tailored-to-you Ads Strategy: </h3>
      <p>We don’t believe in a one-size-fits-all approach to ads. Instead, we build yours around your ideal client, your market, and what’s already working in your SEO. </p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="light" grid={{ rows: [31, 20], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="1/1/14/11" d="1/1/21/12" z={2} align="center" src={img10} alt="Person sitting on a beige couch, taking notes on a clipboard with a pen." sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 46vw" />
    <Text m="15/2/22/10" d="4/14/10/25" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2><span class="c-white">Still not sure if Google ads are right for you? This work makes the biggest impact for practices that are:</span></h2>
    </Text>
    <Text m="22/2/28/10" d="10/14/15/25" z={4} align="center" alignM="start" bulletIcon={img26a860b0f}>
      <ul>
      <li>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white">New to the scene and looking to build visibility fast. </span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white">In a highly competitive market. </span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white">Catered to a defined ideal client. </span></p>
      </li>
      <li>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white">Ready to invest in expedited growth. </span></p>
      </li>
      </ul>
    </Text>
    <Button m="28/2/30/10" d="16/14/18/20" z={6} align="center" href="/contact">get started</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" inset divider={{ height: '2vw', concave: true }} grid={{ rows: [18, 19], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="2/2/17/10" d="3/2/18/26" z={1} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #d34320', radius: '34px' }} src={kaboompicsElegantBusinesswomanInHerOffic} alt="A person sitting on a black chair, wearing a beige blazer and pink pants, using a silver laptop with a black keyboard, with cream-colored curtains in the background." radius="30px" overlay={{ opacity: 1, color: 'hsl(var(--black-hsl) / 0.65)' }} parallax={{ intensity: 20, rotation: 45, zoomStart: 2 }} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw" />
    <Text m="3/3/12/9" d="6/6/12/22" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">A </span><span class="c-accent">faster way</span><span class="c-white"> to fill your caseload.</span></h2>
      <p class="large ta-center"><span class="c-white">Whether you’re a new practice owner or are looking for easier ways to bring in ideal clients, then Paid Google Ads might be just the tx plan you’ve been looking for.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="13/3/15/9" d="12/10/14/18" z={3} align="center" href="/contact">Let’s get started</Button>
  </Section>
</Layout>
